From: SAI-Challenger <noreply@local>
Subject: [PATCH] vslib: add OCS port and cross-connect support

- Seed OCS port read-only attrs (OPER_STATUS=BLOCKED, empty PHYSICAL_MAPPING)
- Validate cross-connect: A != B, ports not already in use
- Update OPER_STATUS on XC create/remove and OVERRIDE_STATE set
  (NORMAL+XC -> TUNED, otherwise BLOCKED)

